<title>CHINA: K.Wah Int'l year profit jumps sharply.</title>
<headline>K.Wah Int'l year profit jumps sharply.</headline>
<dateline>HONG KONG 1997-07-31</dateline>
<text>
<p>Year ended March 31</p>
<p>(in million HK$ unless stated)</p>
<p>     Shr (H.K. cents)	 75	 vs 19</p>
<p>     Dividend (H.K. cents)   8.0	vs 9.0</p>
<p>     Exceptional items     520.82     vs nil</p>
<p>     Net			 711.07   vs 183.06</p>
<p>     Turnover		1,845.49 vs 1,452.25</p>
<p>     Company name	     K. Wah International Holdings Ltd</p>
<p>     Books close		Sept 18-23</p>
<p>     Dividend payable	 Oct 23</p>
<p>NOTE - The company is engaged in property development, manufacturing and sales of construction materials. Exceptional gain is mainly from sale of properties.</p>
<p>-- Hong Kong Newsroom (852) 2843 6370</p>
</text>
